    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 9.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Á sie þæt wite LX scill, oððæt angylde árise to XXX scill; siððan hit to ðam árise þæt angylde, siððan sie þæt wite CXX scill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The fine shall always be 60 shillings until the single-recompense reaches 30 shillings; after the single-recompense reaches this amount or higher, then the fine shall be 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">Until the value amounts to 30 shillings, the fine shall be 60 shillings in every case. When the [said] value amounts to this sum, the fine shall be 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">A sy ðæt wite LX scill', oð ðæt angylde arise to XXX scill'; siððan hit to ðam arise ðæt angylde, siððan sy þæt wite CXX scill'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
